<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $1 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers under 500 lbs were steady to $1.00 per cwt higher, over 500 lbs steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 75.00- 83.50; 700-800 lbs few 74.00-74.50; 800-900 lbs 70.00-73.25. Small 1 400-500 lbs 80.50-84.00. Holsteins - Large 2 500- 600 lbs 62.50-65.75; 700-800 lbs few 62.00-69.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 66.00-74.50; 700-800 lbs 65.50-74.00. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 67.75-70.00.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
